"A bundle of wadding, black gunpowder, and cannonball, ready to be loaded "
"into a cannon."
msgstr ""
"Wiązka watoliny, czarnego prochu i kula armatnia, gotowe do załadowania do "
"armaty."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
