msgid "Nomex scraps"
msgid_plural "Nomex scraps"
msgstr[0] "skrawki Nomeksu"
msgstr[1] "skrawki Nomeksu"
msgstr[2] "skrawków Nomeksu"
msgstr[3] "skrawka Nomeksu"

#. ~ Description for Nomex scraps
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Oddly-shaped smallish bits of heat-resistant Nomex fabric, waste material "
"from tailoring projects.  Normally it's disposed of, but since Nomex would "
"be very difficult to make in a post-apocalyptic world, it might be worth "
"recycling it."
msgstr ""
"Niewielkie kawałki żaroodpornego Nomexu o dziwnym kształcie, odpadki z "
"projektów krawieckich. Normalnie jest wyrzucany, ale ponieważ Nomex byłby "
"bardzo trudny do wytworzenia w postapokaliptycznym świecie, może warto "
"byłoby go przetworzyć."

