#. ~ Description for copper locket
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A circular, copper locket.  It's been tarnished with use, and has gained "
"some dull green spots.  You can wear it if you like, but it won't provide "
"any effects."
msgstr ""
"Okrągły, miedziany medalion. Zużyty, zmatowiały, ma kilka zielonych plamek. "
"Możesz go nosić, jeśli chcesz, ale nie przyniesie to żadnych efektów."

