"and contributions of major pharmaceutical companies.  For the most part, it "
"provides information identical to what is available on that of medication "
"packaging inserts, and cannot match the completeness of digital "
"pharmaceutical references like Medisoft.  At least it doesn't need power to "
"be used."
msgstr ""
"Ten pokaźny tom zawiera wszystkie wymagane prawem informacje istotne dla "
