msgstr[0] "żelatyna z marloss"
msgstr[1] "żelatyna z marloss"
msgstr[2] "żelatyna z marloss"
msgstr[3] "żelatyna z marloss"

#. ~ Description for gelatin
#: lang/json/COMESTIBLE_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If we left this as it should be, one could just walk into the Spire "
"uncontested and partake of the Sap.  Wait, how did you even GET this anyway?"
msgstr ""
"Jeżeli zostawimy to w spokoju, jak być powinno, ktoś mógłby wejść w Iglicę "
"bez walki i czerpać z Żywicy. Chwila, skąd to w ogóle WZIĄŁEŚ?"

