msgstr "Wyczaruj Magiczne Ostrze do Rzutów Cięcie"

#. ~ Message for SPELL 'Conjure Magical Throwing Blade Cut'
#: lang/json/SPELL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You activate your bag and a throwing knife with unnaturally sharp edges "
