msgstr[0] "Colt Delta Elite"
msgstr[1] "Colt Delta Elite"
msgstr[2] "Colt Delta Elite"
msgstr[3] "Colt Delta Elite"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A modernized, match-grade variant of the venerable M1911 chambered in hard-"
"hitting 10mm Auto.  Early variants were known to crack frames; modern "
"1911's, like this one, are slotted to prevent such crack formation."
msgstr ""
"Zmodernizowana, wysokiej klasy odmiana czcigodnego M1911 w mocnym kalibrze "
"10 mm Auto. Wczesne warianty były znane z pękania szkieletu; nowoczesne "
"1911, jak ten, są ryflowane, aby zapobiec powstawaniu takich pęknięć."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
