msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You like to think you're a real sniper, but really you're just infantry with"
" a bigger gun."
msgstr ""
"Myślisz sobie, że jesteś prawdziwym snajperem, ale po prawdzie to jesteś w "
"piechocie z większym gnatem."

