msgid ""
"You were deemed non-essential and made to stay behind during the lab "
"evacuation.  Find a way to escape or starve to death."
msgstr ""
"Uznano cię za zbędnego i pozostawiono podczas ewakuacji laboratorium Znajdź "
"sposób na ucieczkę, albo zgiń z głodu."

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Challenge - Lab Staff' for a female character.
